<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0a192f"><meta name="description" content="<%= description %>"><meta property="og:title" content="<%= title %>"><meta property="og:description" content="<%= description %>"><link rel="canonical" href="https://coft-teal.vercel.app/mobile"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/portfolio.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/premium-polish.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/reference-design-system.css"></head>
<body><a class="skip-link" href="#content">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header page-site-header"><div class="header-inner"><a class="wordmark" href="/"><span class="wordmark-mark">F</span><span>faith<span class="wordmark-dot">.</span></span></a><nav class="primary-nav page-nav" aria-label="Page navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/#work">Work</a><a href="/journal">Journal</a><a href="/#contact">Contact</a></nav></div></header>
<main id="content" class="page-width detail-page"><a class="back-link" href="/">← Back home</a><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> DART · FLUTTER · MOBILE</p><h1 class="subpage-title">Building for<br><em>the pocket.</em></h1><p class="subpage-intro">I’m developing my mobile engineering skills with Dart and Flutter. These projects show what I’m learning, what I’m prototyping and how I’m approaching app architecture.</p>
<div class="mobile-grid"><% projects.forEach((project, index) => { %><article class="mobile-card"><div class="mobile-card-top"><span class="project-index">0<%= index + 1 %> / MOBILE PROJECT</span><span class="status-pill"><%= project.status %></span></div><h2><%= project.name %></h2><p class="mobile-type"><%= project.type %></p><p><%= project.summary %></p><div class="tag-list"><% project.stack.forEach(item => { %><span><%= item %></span><% }) %></div><p class="mobile-detail"><%= project.details %></p><div class="platform-line">PLATFORM · <%= project.platforms.join(' · ') %></div></article><% }) %></div>
<section class="mobile-note"><p class="section-kicker">MY MOBILE ENGINEERING APPROACH</p><h2>Learn the fundamentals.<br><em>Build with purpose.</em></h2><p>I’m focusing on clear app structure, predictable state, accessible interfaces and reliable communication with backend APIs. I’ll label projects honestly as they move from study to prototype to release.</p></section>
</main><footer class="site-footer page-width"><a class="wordmark" href="/"><span class="wordmark-mark">F</span><span>faith<span class="wordmark-dot">.</span></span></a><p>Designed & built by Faith Toluwanimi.</p><span>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %></span><a href="#content" class="back-top">Back to top ↑</a></footer></body></html>
